! STEOM-DLPNO-CCSD def2-SVP def2-SVP/C def2/J RIJCOSX TightSCF TightPNO
# Gas-phase bare anionic chromophore (31 atoms). DLPNO-STEOM-CCSD anchor for the
# canonical-vs-DLPNO validation + cross-code check. Expect ~470-490 (PySCF ADC(2)=476, exp 480).
%maxcore 4000
%pal nprocs 8 end
%mdci
  NRoots 5
  DoRootWise true
  DoStoreSTEOM true
  AddL2Term True
  TCutPNOSingles 1e-12
  NDav 400
  MaxIter 200
end
* xyzfile -1 1 cr2_chromophore.xyz
